                                              "observation":  "The stated motivation explicitly says a cheaper coordinator\u0027s positive rating must not lift Gemini because it is not a leader in the maintainer\u0027s table."
                                          },
                                          {
                                              "kind":  "inferred",
                                              "reference":  ".collab/telemetry-usefulness-2026-10-08/handoffs/01-claude-usefulness-table-framing.md:7-8,43-50",
                                              "observation":  "The listed aggregates contain marks and finding counts, but no independent correctness adjudication or demonstrated judge calibration."
                                          }
                                      ],
                         "verification":  "Evaluate candidate weighting schemes on the same independently adjudicated review cases, checking whether they improve correctness prediction over equal weights.",
